{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"2f658c7c5d24c45f28020b942dcabaeaf6cb53de3b988241c605c333393ff3d8"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:99dede367a3d52b24ba4b8e99573eca843f36b5f6860cb080852b8a98363a497","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"San Francisco","evidence":"[D17:1 | 9:19 am on 2 September, 2023] Dave: Hey Calvin! Been a while, what's up? I'm tied up with car stuff lately, yesterday I came back from San Francsico with some great insights and knowledge on car modification that I want to share with you! Changing things around, and giving an old car a new life - so satisfying!\n[D14:1 | 12:35 am on 14 August, 2023] Dave: Hey Cal, how's it going? Something cool happened since last we talked - I got to go to a car workshop in San Francisco! So cool to dive into the world of car restoration and see all the different techniques. People were really passionate and dedicated - truly inspiring!","itemId":"urn:uuid:6c8a366b-5d8a-5b0d-b9fe-ad147dbf5ef1","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:241ce72903f9af2b19a58fe205eb9191f919ef8cc4074ac030a262c3140deb9b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Where did Dave return from with new knowledge of different techniques of car restoration?","referenceAnswer":"San Francisco","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"241ce72903f9af2b19a58fe205eb9191f919ef8cc4074ac030a262c3140deb9b"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}